# Files Workers Static Assets must NOT serve (assets.directory is ".").
# Mirrors what GitHub Pages (Jekyll) published: Jekyll skips every path segment starting with "_" or ".",
# plus Gemfile/Gemfile.lock. Raw *.md IS served on Pages, so it stays public here too.

# Worker source + config + build helpers (root only: games/rc-dune-buggy/worker/ ships its own
# wrangler.jsonc/package.json and Pages serves them, so keep those public)
/wrangler.jsonc
/wrangler.json
/wrangler.toml
/.wrangler
/_cf

# Jekyll-excluded (404 on Pages today)
_*
.*
/Gemfile
/Gemfile.lock
/CNAME
/node_modules
/package.json
/package-lock.json

# >>> generated by _cf/build.mjs (files over 25 MiB; served from cf-parts/ by _cf/worker.js)
